==Essential improvements==
===Downgrading===
{{ii}} Any save game created previously must be converted. See [[#Incompatible_save_game|here]] for instructions.
{{++}} Downgrading restores the ability to play removed licensed songs from the game for the latest Steam and Rockstar Games Launcher versions, removes modding prevention checks from the Second Edition and Rockstar Games Launcher versions, and removes DRM checks from the Rockstar Games Launcher version.
{{--}} US executable that is provided misses French, German and Italian localization support. See [[#Add more localizations to the in-game language option|here]] for restoration.

{{Fixbox|description=Use San Andreas Downgrader|ref=<ref name="Downgrading" />|fix=
# Download the [http://downgraders.rockstarvision.com/#:~:text=RGSC/Steam%20to%20v1 San Andreas Downgrader] that matches with the version that is currently installed.
# Extract the contents of {{file|SA DOWNGRADER.rar}} (Steam and Rockstar Games Launcher) or {{file|SAv2to1.rar}} (retail Second Edition) to {{folder|{{p|game}}}}.
# Run {{file|install.bat}} to start the downgrading process. The tool will automatically close its command prompt window and remove patch files afterwards.
# Launch the game from the newly created {{file|gta-sa.exe}} v1.0 executable. It is advised to not use the original executable leftover after downgrading, especially for the Rockstar Games Launcher version as it has problems with the modified files and can undo file changes unless it's launched with <code>-scOfflineOnly</code> parameter.
}}

{{Fixbox|description=Use Jetpack Downgrader|ref=<ref>{{Refcheck|user=Thiccfurlizzy|date=2025-04-09}}</ref>|fix=
# Download the latest release of [https://github.com/Zalexanninev15/Jetpack-Downgrader Jetpack Downgrader]
# Extract the contents of {{file|JPD.zip}} to any folder.
# Run {{file|app.exe}} to start the downgrading process.
# The tool will ask you where the game is installed, and enable "Move game to another folder".
# Launch the game from the newly created {{file|gta-sa.exe}} v1.0 executable inside the {{folder|{{p|game}}}}_Downgraded folder.
}}

