{{ii}} Limited support for the latest Steam (December 9, 2014 update) and Rockstar Games Launcher versions. Consider [[#Downgrading|downgrading]] to take full advantage of the mod.
{{++}} Fixes many of the bugs introduced in the PC version like bugged sun flare, rotor blades, road reflections and ''some'' [[#Timing-related issues|timing issues]].<ref>{{Refurl|url=https://gtaforums.com/topic/669045-silentpatch/?do=findComment&comment=1065600043|title=GTAForums — SilentPatch – Silent's post from June 16, 2014|date=2025-07-13}}</ref>
{{++}} Adds new features to the game like FLAC codec support.<ref>{{Refurl|url=https://gtaforums.com/topic/669045-silentpatch/?do=findComment&comment=1065584011|title=GTAForums — SilentPatch – Ash_735's post from June 13, 2014|date=2025-07-13}}</ref>

