====Fixing incompatible save game data====
{{ii}} Save games created with the v2.0 ''executable'' and newer will refuse to load with previous versions.
{{ii}} Saves made with original 1.0 ''scripts'' will fail to load when used with Hot Coffee patched ones, and vice versa. This can be fixed by [https://www.paulinternet.nl/?page=sa converting] them.

{{Fixbox|description=Install [[#SilentPatch|SilentPatch]]|ref=<ref>{{Refurl|url=https://cookieplmonster.github.io/mods/gta-sa/#silentpatch|title=Silent's Blog – ''Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas'' § SilentPatch|snippet=The Steam/RGL version of the game will no longer reject 1.0/1.01 saves (still, a compatible SCM is needed for the save to work).|date=2025-07-13}}</ref>|fix=
'''Notes'''
{{++}} Makes newer versions of the game compatible again with save files created with an older version of the game.
}}

{{Fixbox|description=Convert the save files|ref={{cn|date=2022-11-28}}|fix=
# Go to [https://gtasnp.com/ GTASnP].
# Upload the save from [[#Game data|save game data location]].
# Expand the '''Modifications''' section.
# At '''Downgrade Version''', select the desired version (e.g. downgraded game requires "Script/SCM" version v1, for Steam & Rockstar Games Launcher choose v2).
# Select the preferred download slot below to download the save.
# After downloading, place the save back from where it was uploaded on.
}}

====Portable GTA====
{{ii}} [[#Downgrading|Downgrading]] and [[#ASI Loader|ASI Loader]] required.
{{ii}} This mod moves the user files from {{folder|{{p|userprofile\Documents}}}} to {{folder|{{p|game}}}}.

{{Fixbox|description=Installing Portable GTA|fix=
# Download [https://gtaforums.com/topic/899040-the-heros-workshop/ Portable GTA].
# Rename the file extension from {{file|portablegta.dll}} to {{file|portablegta.asi}}.
# Move {{file|portablegta.asi}} into {{folder|{{p|game}}\scripts\}}.
