===Run the game at screen refresh rate===
{{--}} Fullscreen mode defaults to 60 Hz, even if the screen refresh rate is set higher or lower than that.

{{Fixbox|description=Set screen refresh rate|ref={{cn|date=2022-10-13}}|fix=
# Install [[Special K]]. Manual local installation is recommended.
# Go to the installation folder and rename {{file|SpecialK32.dll}} to {{file|dinput8.dll}}.
# Start the game once and close it to allow the configuration file of Special K to be created.
# Open {{file|{{p|game}}\dinput8.ini}}.
# Change <code>RefreshRate=-1</code> to <code>RefreshRate=0</code> under <code>[Render.FrameRate]</code>.
}}

{{Fixbox|description=Override refresh rate set by game|ref={{cn|date=2024-02-16}}|fix=
# Install [[#ThirteenAG's Widescreen Fix|ThirteenAG's Widescreen Fix]].
